{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8bedcb2b-db0e-11ef-a630-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bedcafb-db0e-11ef-8771-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"平陽縣","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0a3-db0e-11ef-a054-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：縣遣於侯家供事也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：县遣于侯家供事也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0a2-db0e-11ef-bd67-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"青","people_name_jianti_auto":"青","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0a5-db0e-11ef-90f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑氏","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0a6-db0e-11ef-ad42-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"衞","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0a7-db0e-11ef-a532-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"冒姓者，青本鄭氏子而冒衞姓也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"冒姓者，青本郑氏子而冒衞姓也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0a4-db0e-11ef-9e38-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"館陶公主","people_name_jianti_auto":"馆陶公主","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0a9-db0e-11ef-b250-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"大長公主，卽館陶公主也。長，知兩翻。騎，奇寄翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"大长公主，即馆陶公主也。长，知两翻。骑，奇寄翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0a8-db0e-11ef-b16a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"郞之騎從者。郞中有車、戶、騎三將。逆取曰篡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"郞之骑从者。郞中有车、户、骑三将。逆取曰篡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0aa-db0e-11ef-8b7e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"青","people_name_jianti_auto":"青","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0ac-db0e-11ef-a1a5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"建章宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"建章宫","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0ad-db0e-11ef-8e75-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建章宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"建章宫","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0ae-db0e-11ef-911b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建章","place_name_jianti_auto":"建章","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0af-db0e-11ef-9662-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"建章宮監。據史，太初元年起建章宮，蓋因舊宮而大起也。青時爲建章監而兼侍中。","note_content_jianti_auto":"建章宫监。据史，太初元年起建章宫，盖因旧宫而大起也。青时为建章监而兼侍中。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0ab-db0e-11ef-8017-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"平陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"平阳县","place_note":"山西临汾","resolved_place_entity_id":4599,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0b3-db0e-11ef-9528-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"子夫同母弟衞青，其父鄭季，本平陽縣吏，給事侯家，與衞媼私通而生青，冒姓衞氏。青長，爲侯家騎奴。大長公主執囚青，欲殺之；其友騎郞公孫敖與壯士篡取之。上聞，乃召青爲建章監、侍中，賞賜數日間累千金。旣而以子夫爲夫人，青爲太中大夫。","content_fanyi":"卫子夫的同母异父弟卫青，他的父亲郑季原本是平阳县的县吏，到平阳侯家中当差供职，与卫媪私通生下卫青，让卫青冒姓卫氏。卫青长大后，在平阳侯家中做骑奴。大长公主刘嫖抓住卫青并囚禁起来，想杀掉他；他的朋友骑郎公孙敖和壮士一起把卫青强行夺回。汉武帝听说此事后，便召见卫青，任命他为建章监、侍中，几天之内赏赐累计达千金。不久，汉武帝立卫子夫为夫人，任命卫青为太中大夫。","content_jianti_auto":"子夫同母弟衞青，其父郑季，本平阳县吏，给事侯家，与衞媪私通而生青，冒姓衞氏。青长，为侯家骑奴。大长公主执囚青，欲杀之；其友骑郞公孙敖与壮士篡取之。上闻，乃召青为建章监、侍中，赏赐数日间累千金。既而以子夫为夫人，青为太中大夫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1382,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第十七 (漢紀九) / 世宗孝武皇帝上之上 / 二年 / 第 10 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8f58e0a1-db0e-11ef-9883-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-139},"tongjian_id":"8f58e0a1-db0e-11ef-9883-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"平陽縣","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"霍","people_name_jianti_auto":"霍","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8fb579ff-db0e-11ef-872e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"霍姓，以國爲氏。","note_content_jianti_auto":"霍姓，以国为氏。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8fb579fe-db0e-11ef-9bdf-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"服虔","people_name_jianti_auto":"服虔","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a01-db0e-11ef-9116-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a02-db0e-11ef-bd51-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"荀悅","people_name_jianti_auto":"荀悦","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a03-db0e-11ef-9820-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"去病","people_name_jianti_auto":"去病","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a04-db0e-11ef-8211-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"服虔曰：票姚，音飄搖。師古曰：票，匹妙翻。姚，羊召翻。票姚，勁疾之貌。荀悅漢紀作「票鷂」字。去病後爲票騎將軍，尚取票姚之字耳。今讀者音飄搖，則不當其義也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"服虔曰：票姚，音飘摇。师古曰：票，匹妙翻。姚，羊召翻。票姚，劲疾之貌。荀悦汉纪作「票鹞」字。去病后为票骑将军，尚取票姚之字耳。今读者音飘摇，则不当其义也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a00-db0e-11ef-a0ea-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a07-db0e-11ef-80fb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a08-db0e-11ef-8534-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a09-db0e-11ef-a6fd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：計其所將人數，則捕斬首爲多，過於所當。一曰：漢軍失亡者少，而殺獲匈奴數多，故曰過當也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：计其所将人数，则捕斩首为多，过于所当。一曰：汉军失亡者少，而杀获匈奴数多，故曰过当也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a06-db0e-11ef-be4f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"左","people_name_jianti_auto":"左","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a0b-db0e-11ef-8fa4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"右大當戶","people_name_jianti_auto":"右大当户","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a0c-db0e-11ef-9766-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"左","people_name_jianti_auto":"左","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a0d-db0e-11ef-a341-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"右骨都侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"右骨都侯","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a0e-db0e-11ef-af21-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張晏","people_name_jianti_auto":"张晏","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a0f-db0e-11ef-803d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"藉若","people_name_jianti_auto":"藉若","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a10-db0e-11ef-abe6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"產","people_name_jianti_auto":"产","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a11-db0e-11ef-9793-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a12-db0e-11ef-95ea-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"羅姑","people_name_jianti_auto":"罗姑","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a13-db0e-11ef-aaca-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a14-db0e-11ef-9d3b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"胡","place_name_jianti_auto":"胡","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a15-db0e-11ef-b0ef-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"匈奴左、右大當戶，在左、右大都尉之下，左、右骨都侯之上。大父行，單于祖行也。張晏曰：藉若，胡侯也，產，其名也。師古曰：此人，單于祖父之行也。季父，亦單于季父也，羅姑，其名。行，戶浪翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"匈奴左、右大当户，在左、右大都尉之下，左、右骨都侯之上。大父行，单于祖行也。张晏曰：藉若，胡侯也，产，其名也。师古曰：此人，单于祖父之行也。季父，亦单于季父也，罗姑，其名。行，户浪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a0a-db0e-11ef-ae3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a17-db0e-11ef-904b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：比，頻也。比，毗至翻。冠，古玩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：比，频也。比，毗至翻。冠，古玩翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":135,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a16-db0e-11ef-80dc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"去病","people_name_jianti_auto":"去病","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8fb57a19-db0e-11ef-8959-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"pl